---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import StoryCard from '../components/StoryCard.astro';
import { getPosts, getCategories } from '../lib/dashless.mjs';
const posts=await getPosts();const categories=await getCategories();const [lead,...rest]=posts;
---
<SiteLayout>
<div class="issue-line"><span>THE OCCASIONAL BULLETIN · VOL. 01</span><span>EST. AFTER SOMEONE COMPLAINED</span></div>
<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">OFFICIALLY LOOKING INTO IT</p><h1>A big fuss.<br/>About very little<span class="red-dot">.</span></h1><p>Reports from the front lines of everyday inconvenience.<br class="desktop-break"/> Someone should really do something. We're writing it down.</p></div><div class="department-stamp" aria-label="Nothing is under control">NOTHING IS<br/><strong>UNDER<br/>CONTROL</strong><span>AND THAT'S OFFICIAL</span></div></section>
<section class="lead-story" aria-labelledby="lead-title"><a href={lead.url} class="lead-photo"><img src={lead.featuredImage.src} alt={lead.featuredImage.alt} width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"/><span class="photo-slip">EXHIBIT 007 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><div class="lead-copy"><div class="story-overline"><span class="status-dot"></span> THE BIG LITTLE STORY <span class="case-number">№ 007</span></div><a class="category-link" href={lead.categoryTerms[0].url}>{lead.categoryTerms[0].name}</a><h2 id="lead-title"><a href={lead.url}>Seven objects<br class="desktop-break"/> currently occupying<br class="desktop-break"/> the chair.</a></h2><p>It was purchased for sitting. Its responsibilities have since expanded.</p><div class="lead-bottom"><span class="byline">A photographic investigation<br/>16 September 2026 · 3 min read</span><a class="button-link" href={lead.url}>Examine the evidence <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<div class="bulletin-layout"><section class="latest-section" aria-labelledby="latest-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="latest-heading">Other pressing matters</h2><span>SMALL PROBLEMS. FULL COVERAGE.</span></div><div class="story-grid">{rest.slice(0,4).map((story:any)=><StoryCard story={story}/>)}</div><a class="all-stories" href="/stories/">Visit the complete archive <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section><aside class="noticeboard" aria-label="Department notices"><section class="pinned-note"><span class="pin" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="eyebrow">INTERNAL MEMO</p><h2>Please stop<br/>replying all.</h2><p>This message has been sent to all staff to remind all staff not to send messages to all staff.</p><span class="note-signature">— Management</span></section><section class="department-list"><h2>Find your department</h2>{categories.map((term,index)=><a href={term.url}><span class="department-number">0{index+1}</span><span>{term.name}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</section><section class="office-hours"><span class="eyebrow">CURRENT OFFICE STATUS</span><p><span class="status-dot"></span> Probably making tea.</p><a href="/about/staff/">Meet the people looking into it →</a></section></aside></div>
<section class="bottom-note"><span class="big-asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><h2>Your small corner of the internet.</h2><p>This is a sample blog made with Dashless. Yours can be about absolutely anything.<br/>Even, apparently, a chair.</p></div><a href="/about/#a-dashless-demo">About this demo ↗</a></section>
</SiteLayout>
